{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prince, an escaped prisoner, a usurper, a brute, a fighter. Karder Dal-Arouya is many things but has one goal in life: to conquer the empire stolen from him by his treacherous queen mother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Karder on his adventures to reclaim his throne. On his quests you will meet friends and foes, powerful beasts and sexy rulers. Dominate your defeated foes and decide whether you want to use them for your dark pleasures or seduce them to aid you with their skills and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/bcecd3aa3782ea182c5e2b716e8f66d8.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new release will include a new fiefdom to conquer, new ruler to defeat and abuse (or seduce and recruit) and a miniquest offering unique combats, unforgettable sexual encounters and fun puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vae victis - khan offers the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alluring rulers to defeat and decide their fate: whether to abuse them in your dungeons or to recruit them to your council and eventually seduce them <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/2bf6f6a13d7fdddbb1bf23313dc591fa.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=357 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and unique Rock, Scissors, Paper based one on one combat with some interesting twists such as aggressive or defensive attacks, subdue attacks for taking your (sexy) opponents unharmed and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/22d1e35f5b6e577d7a4e5e7dcb3a657a.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=357 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiefdom management aspect: increase your Troops and Gold reserves so you can wage wars on new fiefdoms but monitor your fiefdoms Morale and Obedience lest you lose them to rebellions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/0f9c3ed97eca006898dc4c29ab21503f.avif?t=1764772338\" width=668 height=332 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miniquests for sabotaging enemy fiefdoms, obtaining powerful magical artifacts and more. Some characters you'll meet in those quests can be revisited later, allowing you to see how meeting you altered the course of their lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/f1097fb3dc95e56e49fd0d97c54ccd15.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=356 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong impregnation theme, most sexual encounters will elaborate on Karder's desire to dominate and breed his defeated opponents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/adf50cb67dc70e2663eef600ca005ec5.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=356 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, we release additional fiefdoms (and wenches) to conquer, elaborate on the back story and introduce additional features such as enhanced army combat and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540230/extras/291b60b5db4bc83eb2105334ac4f1608.avif?t=1764772338\" width=634 height=356 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vae victis - Khan is a very NSFW game. Its protagonist is a complete bastard who doesn't hesitate to abuse and exploit other people but you will (almost) always have the option to choose a mild (yet highly erotic) path as well. There is no gore or blood during the sexual scenes of the game but other than that Karder can be a total sadist.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prison Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/cec71922a860ea9986376d169730010ef40ce341.jpg"},{"name":"Burning down the house","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/d43944b2478a4af5eb1cc3006179f361c82dd3fb.jpg"},{"name":"Fahda's Chest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/b1311ad899da68757dad8ec7ca690a19c3f62c21.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/cec71922a860ea9986376d169730010ef40ce341.jpg"},{"name":"The Dark Harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/a157efc1b179d5b6522d10998478e0ee042958d9.jpg"},{"name":"Unearthed Arcana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/459342c496081cbcfa7713baa70eb4fead8562c9.jpg"},{"name":"Queen of the Amazons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/2112d5e39617b8afd0e28f8b1674ea8e67ddd26d.jpg"},{"name":"Greenskins and Horns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/141a2e86b9bac9da4a3392ab434614a4b40e111c.jpg"},{"name":"Untainted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/55978749186bb25207db1786036641486e05f7a2.jpg"},{"name":"Massive hills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2540230/8f52e688fc416bbe19c645e83ba2c1d807391986.jpg"}],"total":76},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/25